{'symbol': 'STLD', 'date': '2022-05-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'STEEL DYNAMICS ANNOUNCES PLANNED ACQUISITION OF A MEXICAN METALS RECYCLING COMPANY', 'text': 'FORT WAYNE, IND. , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STEEL DYNAMICS, INC. (NASDAQ/GS: STLD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT AS PART OF ITS NORTH AMERICAN RAW MATERIAL PROCUREMENT STRATEGY, THE COMPANY HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE EQUITY INTEREST OF ROCA ACERO S.A.'}